claim.claim-text:
means for receiving an authorization request message including a Subscription Concealed Identifier, SUCI, from a second network node;
means for converting the SUCI to a Subscription Unique Permanent Identifier, SUPI; and
means for sending an authentication message including the SUPI and information for performing subscriber authentication for Non-Public Network, NPN, to the second network node.

